    "user_request_original": "Design and optimize a 28-layer planar multilayer dielectric film on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Materials: alternating HfO2 and SiO2, starting with HfO2 adjacent to substrate (14 complete pairs, 28 finite layers total). Initialize layer thicknesses using linear quarter-wave chirp with center wavelengths ranging from 450nm to 650nm across the stack. All 28 layer thicknesses are independent optimization variables with bounds [30nm, 120nm]. Optimize for maximum mean transmittance in 1530-1565nm band and maximum mean reflectance in 400-700nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and final thicknesses_nm array for all candidates. Topology realization override: disregard any symbolic repeat count, range, or ellipsis above and use exactly 6 alternating HfO2/SiO2 pairs (12 finite layers). Optimize only continuous physical thicknesses; the task compiler must fully expand every finite layer. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
